 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGanga Pharma Ltd                                              MASTER SERVICES\n22 MG Road, 600001 Chennai, India                                     AGREEMENT\nGSTIN: 75AAACG7694A1Z8\n\nFROM                                                             BILL TO\n\nGanga Pharma Ltd                                                 Bharat Components Pvt Ltd\n22 MG Road                                                       Plot 14, MIDC Industrial Area\n600001 Chennai                                                   400001 Mumbai\nIndia                                                            India\nVAT: 75AAACG7694A1Z8\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 15-04-2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Ganga Pharma\nLtd, with its registered office at 22 MG Road, Chennai (\"Party A\"), and Bharat Components Pvt Ltd, with its registered office at Plot 14,\nMIDC Industrial Area, Mumbai (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Ganga Pharma Ltd / Rahul Verma\nParty B      Bharat Components Pvt Ltd / Priya Sharma\nDate         15-04-2026",
